---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="hero-badge">● WAKE FOREST &amp; NORTHERN WAKE COUNTY · 24 / 7 EMERGENCY SERVICE</div>
        <h1>ROOFERS IN<br /><span>WAKE FOREST</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Fast Repairs. Honest Pricing. Same-Day Response.</p>
        <p class="hero-desc">When your roof leaks or storm damage hits in Wake Forest, every hour counts. Our licensed local roofers deliver expert repairs, free estimates, and workmanship backed by a written guarantee for homes across northern Wake County.</p>
        <div class="hero-tags">
          <span class="hero-tag">⏱ Same-Day Response</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">🛡 Licensed &amp; Insured</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">✓ Free Estimates</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">📞 24 / 7 Emergency</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">🛡 Workmanship Guarantee</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule an Appointment</a>
          <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-outline">Get a Free Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-card-icon">🏠</div>
          <h3>Roof Leaking?</h3>
          <p>We diagnose and repair asphalt shingle, metal, and flat roofs the same day in most cases.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Us -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="why">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Why Wake Forest Homeowners <span>Choose Us</span></h2>
        <p>Wake Forest roofs take a beating from Carolina storms, heat, and aging shingles. You need a licensed local contractor who shows up fast and fixes it right the first time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Same-Day Diagnosis &amp; Repair</h3>
          <p>Most emergency and leak calls in Wake Forest are assessed and repaired within hours — no multi-day waits for basic fixes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📜</div>
          <h3>Licensed &amp; Insured</h3>
          <p>Every crew is licensed in North Carolina, fully insured, and experienced with asphalt shingles, metal, TPO, and architectural systems common in Wake County.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">💵</div>
          <h3>Upfront Pricing, Zero Surprises</h3>
          <p>We quote before we start. No hidden fees, no pressure tactics — just honest roofing at fair local rates.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📍</div>
          <h3>Local to Wake Forest</h3>
          <p>Based near Camp Kanata Rd — we know the neighborhoods, common roof ages, and storm patterns that hit Heritage, Traditions, and downtown Wake Forest.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stats-row">
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>Under 60 min</strong><span>Avg. Response Goal</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>98%</strong><span>First-Visit Fix Rate</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>24/7</strong><span>Emergency Available</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problems preview -->
  <section class="section" id="problems">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Recognize <span>These Signs?</span></h2>
        <p>Storms, age, and heat accelerate roof wear in Wake Forest. If you notice any of these, don’t wait for the next rain.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problems-grid">
        <a href="/problems/roof-leaks/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Roof Leaks</h3>
          <p>Water stains on ceilings or active dripping signal a compromised roof. Same-day emergency tarping and permanent repair available.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/missing-shingles/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Missing or Damaged Shingles</h3>
          <p>Blown-off or curled shingles leave your underlayment exposed. Fast replacement prevents bigger leaks.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/storm-damage/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Storm &amp; Hail Damage</h3>
          <p>Hail and high winds leave bruises and lifted shingles. Free inspections help with insurance claims.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/sagging-roof/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>Sagging Roof</h3>
          <p>Visible dips or soft spots can mean structural issues. Early inspection protects your home’s integrity.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/water-stains/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>Ceiling Water Stains</h3>
          <p>Brown rings or discoloration usually start as a small roof or flashing leak. Catch it before mold spreads.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/gutter-problems/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>Gutter Problems</h3>
          <p>Clogged, sagging, or detached gutters dump water against the foundation and fascia.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services preview -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="services">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Expert Roofing <span>Services</span></h2>
        <p>Every roof problem has a root cause. Our certified crews diagnose accurately and repair or replace correctly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Urgent Response</span>
          <h3>Emergency Roof Repair</h3>
          <p>When a leak or storm damage hits at the worst moment, we respond around the clock — temporary tarping and permanent fixes.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Available 24 / 7</li>
            <li>Fast response goal</li>
            <li>Stocked service trucks</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/emergency-roof-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Most Common</span>
          <h3>Roof Leak Repair</h3>
          <p>Locate the source — flashing, valleys, penetrations, or shingles — and seal it properly so it stays dry.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Full diagnostic</li>
            <li>Written estimate first</li>
            <li>Same-visit repairs when possible</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/roof-leak-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Full Solution</span>
          <h3>Roof Replacement</h3>
          <p>Architectural shingles, metal, and flat systems installed to code with proper underlayment and ventilation.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Manufacturer warranties</li>
            <li>Insurance claim help</li>
            <li>Clean job sites</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/roof-replacement/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Prevention</span>
          <h3>Roof Inspection</h3>
          <p>Detailed inspections after storms or before buying/selling. Photo reports and clear recommendations.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Free post-storm inspections</li>
            <li>Insurance documentation</li>
            <li>Honest repair vs replace advice</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/roof-inspection/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">After the Storm</span>
          <h3>Storm Damage Repair</h3>
          <p>Hail, wind, and fallen limbs. We document damage, work with adjusters, and restore your roof quickly.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Insurance-friendly process</li>
            <li>Emergency board-up / tarp</li>
            <li>Full restoration</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/storm-damage-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Protective</span>
          <h3>Roof Maintenance</h3>
          <p>Preventive cleaning, minor repairs, and ventilation checks that extend the life of your roof system.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Debris &amp; moss removal</li>
            <li>Flashing touch-ups</li>
            <li>Gutter cleaning options</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/roof-maintenance/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process -->
  <section class="section" id="process">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>How We Protect <span>Your Home</span></h2>
        <p>Every Wake Forest roofing job follows a clear, transparent process.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-steps">
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">01</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Call or Request Service</h3>
            <p>Tell us what’s happening. We schedule same-day or next available slots and arrive prepared with the right materials.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">02</div>
          <div>
            <h3>On-Site Inspection</h3>
            <p>We examine shingles, flashing, valleys, penetrations, decking, and attic conditions. Photos and findings are shared with you.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">03</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Clear Options &amp; Written Estimate</h3>
            <p>You receive a plain-language explanation and a written quote before any work starts. No pressure.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">04</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Professional Repair or Replacement</h3>
            <p>Approved work is completed by experienced crews. We protect landscaping and leave the site clean.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">05</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Final Walkthrough &amp; Guarantee</h3>
            <p>We review the completed work with you and back it with a written workmanship guarantee.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Map / Location -->
  <section class="section section-alt map-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Find Us in <span>Wake Forest, NC</span></h2>
        <p>Proudly serving Wake Forest and northern Wake County from Camp Kanata Road.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="map-wrapper" style="height:380px;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
        <iframe title="Map of 12805 Camp Kanata Rd, Wake Forest, NC" src="https://www.openstreetmap.org/export/embed.html?bbox=-78.5197%2C35.9699%2C-78.4997%2C35.9899&amp;layer=mapnik&amp;marker=35.9799%2C-78.5097" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;height:100%;border:0"></iframe>
      </div>
      <p style="text-align:center;color:var(--text-muted)">📍 12805 Camp Kanata Rd, Wake Forest, NC 27587<br />Serving Wake Forest · Rolesville · Youngsville · Franklinton · northern Raleigh and surrounding communities.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Roof Problem in Wake Forest?</h2>
      <p>Don’t wait for the next storm. If your roof is leaking, missing shingles, or showing storm damage — our team can respond today.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="section" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Roofing Questions</h2>
        <p>Real answers to what Wake Forest homeowners ask most.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>My roof is leaking — is this an emergency?</h3>
          <p>Yes if water is actively entering the living space. We provide emergency tarping to stop further damage, then permanent repair as soon as materials and weather allow. Call early in the day for the fastest same-day response.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>How much does roof repair cost in Wake Forest?</h3>
          <p>Simple shingle or flashing repairs often start in the low hundreds. Larger sections or structural issues cost more. We always provide a written estimate before work begins. Full replacement is quoted after a complete inspection.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Do you work with insurance claims?</h3>
          <p>Yes. We document damage thoroughly, meet with adjusters when needed, and help you navigate the claim process for storm and hail damage common in the Triangle.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Are you licensed and insured in North Carolina?</h3>
          <p>Yes. All work is performed by licensed, insured roofing professionals familiar with North Carolina building codes and best practices for Wake County homes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Should I repair or replace my roof?</h3>
          <p>Repair usually makes sense if the roof is under 15–20 years old and damage is localized. Replacement is often better for roofs near the end of their life, widespread storm damage, or when repair costs approach half the value of a new system. We give an honest assessment either way.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
